    {
      "label": "Proportions",
      "text": "3.34 heads tall. Broad sleeve caps, generous cheeks, compact waist and weighted oxford toes."
    },
    {
      "label": "Hairline",
      "text": "A high asymmetric pompadour rolls back over a fitted short nape. Seven overlapping tapered clumps carry chestnut highlights; two shorter temple curls frame the face."
    },
    {
      "label": "Expression",
      "text": "Large warm chestnut irises with twin catchlights, broad expressive brows, a rounded nose and an open, turned-up smile."
    },
    {
      "label": "Tailoring",
      "text": "Warm charcoal pinstripes follow the suit and trouser grain. Notched lapels reveal ivory cotton, a walnut waistcoat, burgundy silk and a wine pocket square."
    },
    {
      "label": "Accessories",
      "text": "The right hand carries a stemmed red-wine glass. A brass-gold watch chain loops across the left waistcoat and ends at a small keeper."
    },
    {
